#### 2. Sequential Async Pipeline (`src/data-pipeline/pipeline.ts`)
The orchestrator converts the 3-level callback nesting into a sequential `async/await` chain returning `Promise<PipelineResult>` with structured `try/catch` blocks wrapping stage failures in typed `PipelineStageError` instances:

```typescript
